    "text": "This is a heuristic solution, and I have not compiled or run it, including against the sample.\n\n1. **Gifts within range of Lapland.** Any gift whose location is within D of (0,0) is loaded and delivered immediately, with no movement.\n2. **One delivery trip.** Among the remaining gifts, the program tries the 40 highest-scoring ones. It loads one gift plus K carrots (K tried from {10, 30, 100, 300, 1000}). It then flies for a chosen total time, which starts at 1 second and grows by roughly 8% each step, capped at T.\n3. **Steering.** Each second the program predicts where the sleigh ends up if it just floats. It then accelerates along the axis with the larger error by about error divided by remaining time, clamped to the current maximum acceleration, and floats one second. The error therefore shrinks as the deadline nears.\n4. **Validation.** A trip is accepted only if the final position is within D of the child. The first accepted trip is output, followed by `DeliverGift`.\n5. **Validity.** Every acceleration is followed by a float, weight is tracked after each carrot is eaten, and the total float time never exceeds T.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\ntypedef long long ll;\nint T,D,W,G;\nvector<ll> L,A;\nstruct Gift{string name;int s,w;ll c,r;};\nint accOf(ll w){for(int i=0;i<W;i++)if(w<=L[i])return (int)A[i];return 0;}\nint main(){\n    scanf(\"%d %d %d %d\",&T,&D,&W,&G);\n    L.resize(W);A.resize(W);\n    for(int i=0;i<W;i++)scanf(\"%lld %lld\",&L[i],&A[i]);\n    vector<Gift> g(G);\n    char buf[64];\n    for(auto&x:g){scanf(\"%s %d %d %lld %lld\",buf,&x.s,&x.w,&x.c,&x.r);x.name=buf;}\n    vector<string> out;\n    vector<int> rest;\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++){\n        ll d2=g[i].c*g[i].c+g[i].r*g[i].r;\n        if(d2<=(ll)D*D){\n            out.push_back(\"LoadGift \"+g[i].name);\n            out.push_back(\"DeliverGift \"+g[i].name);\n        } else rest.push_back(i);\n    }\n    sort(rest.begin(),rest.end(),[&](int a,int b){\n        if(g[a].s!=g[b].s)return g[a].s>g[b].s;return a<b;});\n    int cand=min<int>(40,rest.size());\n    int Ks[5]={10,30,100,300,1000};\n    bool done=false;\n    for(int ci=0;ci<cand&&!done;ci++){\n        const Gift&gf=g[rest[ci]];\n        ll X=gf.c,Y=gf.r;\n        for(ll Tt=1;Tt<=T&&!done;){\n            for(int ki=0;ki<5&&!done;ki++){\n                int K=Ks[ki];\n                ll w=gf.w+K;\n                if(accOf(w)==0)continue;\n                ll px=0,py=0,vx=0,vy=0;\n                int car=K;\n                vector<pair<char,int>> ops;\n                bool bad=false;\n                for(ll t=0;t<Tt;t++){\n                    ll rem=Tt-t;\n                    ll ex=X-(px+vx*rem),ey=Y-(py+vy*rem);\n                    int am=car>0?accOf(w):0;\n                    bool useX=llabs(ex)>=llabs(ey);\n                    ll e=useX?ex:ey;\n                    ll dv=0;\n                    if(am>0){\n                        // round e/rem\n                        ll q=(llabs(e)*2+rem)/(2*rem);\n                        if(e<0)q=-q;\n                        dv=max<ll>(-am,min<ll>(am,q));\n                    }\n                    if(dv!=0){\n                        if(useX){vx+=dv;ops.push_back({dv>0?'R':'L',(int)llabs(dv)});}\n                        else{vy+=dv;ops.push_back({dv>0?'U':'D',(int)llabs(dv)});}\n                        car--;w--;\n                    }\n                    ops.push_back({'F',1});\n                    px+=vx;py+=vy;\n                }\n                __int128 dx=X-px,dy=Y-py;\n                if(dx*dx+dy*dy<=(__int128)D*D){\n                    out.push_back(\"LoadCarrots \"+to_string(K));\n                    out.push_back(\"LoadGift \"+gf.name);\n                    int pend=0;\n                    auto flush=[&](){if(pend){out.push_back(\"Float \"+to_string(pend));pend=0;}};\n                    for(auto&o:ops){\n                        if(o.first=='F'){pend+=o.second;continue;}\n                        flush();\n                        const char*nm=o.first=='R'?\"AccRight \":o.first=='L'?\"AccLeft \":o.first=='U'?\"AccUp \":\"AccDown \";\n                        out.push_back(string(nm)+to_string(o.second));\n                    }\n                    flush();\n                    out.push_back(\"DeliverGift \"+gf.name);\n                    done=true;\n                }\n                (void)bad;\n            }\n            ll nt=max(Tt+1,(ll)(Tt*1.08));\n            if(Tt<T&&nt>T)nt=T;\n            if(Tt==T)break;\n            Tt=nt;\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",(int)out.size());\n    for(auto&s:out)printf(\"%s\\n\",s.c_str());\n}\n```",
